			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"拉菲克",
					"綺珊"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230200101,
					"content": "…所以說，我覺得這一塊區域的材料是不能這麼省的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200102,
					"content": "放心吧，這部分區域的強度肯定足夠了，我算了很多遍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200103,
					"content": "唉，都說了有很多問題是算不出來的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200104,
					"content": "你們在爭什麼呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230200105,
					"content": "#是{F#妳}{M#你}啊，我們正在討論我那艘船的設計問題呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200106,
					"content": "我已經進行了充分的計算，保證每一個區域都有充分的強度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200107,
					"content": "但綺珊堅持說，那些區域的強度不一定可靠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200108,
					"content": "你說的那些「強度」都只存在於理論上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200109,
					"content": "船下水了之後要承受的強度，一定會遠遠高於這個數值。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200110,
					"content": "道理我都懂…但、但我手頭的資金有限…還有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200111,
					"content": "要是再採購更貴的材料，我頂多只能把這艘船的龍骨造完了…咳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200112,
					"content": "總之！目前這艘船就先按照我的方案來吧，材料我都採購完了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200113,
					"content": "#旅行者，如果{F#妳}{M#你}願意的話，能幫我去先搬一部分材料回來嗎？我一個人實在是搬不完…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200114,
						230200115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200114,
					"content": "沒問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230200118,
					"content": "#那就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了，我還得在這裡計算一些東西。等計算完了，我再去把剩下的材料搬回來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200115,
					"content": "綺珊也懂造船？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230200116,
					"content": "對啊，她在計算某些部分的時候比我算得還快呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				},
				{
					"id": 230200117,
					"content": "真不知道她為什麼在這裡做服務生…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230200118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉菲克"
				}
			]
		},
